    "i completed APOLLO's task and he handed me my win! it was a picture of a CGI trophy with the caption \"YOU'RE WINNER !\"": "我完成了阿波罗的任务，他把通关奖励给我了！是一张CGI做的奖杯图片，上面写着“你赢了！”。",

